WEBVTT

NOTE
The X-ATM092 chase through Dollet's streets.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 14 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
Dollet's cobblestone main street at evening, viewed through an archway — colorful shops, a small car.

00:10.000 --> 00:20.000
The X-ATM092 mechanical spider enters the town, its massive legs crashing through narrow streets.

00:20.000 --> 00:30.000
Squall, Zell, and Selphie sprint through Dollet's winding streets with the robot in pursuit.

00:30.000 --> 00:40.000
The X-ATM092's leg slams onto a wooden bridge, splintering the planks beneath it.

00:40.000 --> 00:50.000
The team races across the bridge; debris and smoke fill the air as the robot pursues.

00:50.000 --> 01:00.000
The candidates burst onto the beach, the X-ATM092 looming behind against the orange sky.

01:00.000 --> 01:08.000
Quistis opens fire from a mounted machine gun on one of the extraction boats, driving back the robot.

01:08.000 --> 01:14.000
The landing craft pull away from shore, leaving the robot behind on the beach.
